(Every elder referred to MSC undergoes a standardized 5-point vulnerability assessment evaluating: \(a\)) Tj
T* (physical mobility, \(b\) caregiver availability, \(c\) nutritional security, \(d\) shelter integrity, and \(e\) immediate) Tj
T* (psychological safety. Field workers must prioritize category 1 and 2 individuals living alone without) Tj
T* (relatives.) Tj
